# Simulation

Follow `docs/ARCHITECTURE.md` and `docs/TESTING_PLAN.md`.

- Simulation uses the game PRNG and tick counter, not wall-clock time and not `std::rand` for new logic.
- Commands must be ordered, validated, and serializable before multiplayer can be claimed.
- New scans of every entity or tile need an invalidation story. Prefer events and bounded work.
- Passenger and cargo features must keep a classic anonymous-cargo mode.
- Do not claim multiplayer works. `NetworkBase` exists; the title-screen control is hidden and the checksum fields are unused.
- Record determinism tests before marking a simulation feature complete.
